itle":"","content":"Hmmn thinking on how well gifts will work against them.<br /> <br /> Think Liars Face &quot;Theirs important supernatural stuff in town!&quot; would be enough to get them to decide theirs nothing worth seeing.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/2iw20supportergarou125p\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/0j5hz8j\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/i/idnSdTJkj\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://i.imgsafe.org/97fd805379.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1153-prince-of-the-night","name":"Prince of the Night","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4205"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-16T17:08:45-07:00","id":970991,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Prince of the Night</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/965959-awws-what-a-lovely-human-lets-keep-it?p=970618#post970618\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Am curious any ideas what happened to Senator Grubbob in wake of the shake up did he lose faith in the division, or get &quot;Dealt with&quot; By the Garou.</div> </div> </div> </div>Considering that his daughter was a Silver Fang (as in a werewolf), it sort of begs the question. Grubholb might have been unknowing Kin himself, in which case the tribe sooner or later probably would have considered him a liability at best and a traitor at worst. Alternately, he could have been perfectly normal and inadvertently married into &quot;the family&quot; (so to speak). Either way, considering how careless the Fangs apparently are about bumping off high-profile government people, I would expect that's <i>precisely</i> what happened to him. Probably why the SAD went into decline too.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Saur Ops Specialist</strong> </div> <div class=\"message\">And you'd think that might be a problem, but apparently the modern skeleton crew SAD doesn't have the resources to follow up on every last old member that's gone missing or ended up dead.</div> </div> </div> </div> Which may or may not (probably not, if history is any guide) be a permanent condition. Dismissively offing government people is <i>not</i> a smart long-term choice.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imagizer.imageshack.us/v2/125x125q90/19/w20supporterheavymetal1.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imagizer.imageshack.us/v2/125x125q90/546/wpur.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imagizer.imageshack.us/v2/125x125q90/545/7z8m.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imagizer.imageshack.us/v2/125x125q90/829/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3506-uniform-two-six","name":"Uniform Two Six","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3506_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"455"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-16T17:41:25-07:00","id":971021,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Uniform Two Six</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/965959-awws-what-a-lovely-human-lets-keep-it?p=970991#post970991\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Considering that his daughter was a Silver Fang (as in a werewolf), it sort of begs the question. Grubholb might have been unknowing Kin himself, in which case the tribe sooner or later probably would have considered him a liability at best and a traitor at worst. Alternately, he could have been perfectly normal and inadvertently married into &quot;the family&quot; (so to speak). Either way, considering how careless the Fangs apparently are about bumping off high-profile government people, I would expect that's <i>precisely</i> what happened to him. Probably why the SAD went into decline too.</div> </div> </div> </div>Fianna, actually, and there's nothing to show that Garou have been nearly so careless, at least overall. Also, HH2 presents the downfall of SAD as more of a vampire problem, stemming from fallout from their meddling in the NSA, and as a result of governmental changes brought about by the formation of Homeland Security.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Which may or may not (probably not, if history is any guide) be a permanent condition. Dismissively offing government people is <i>not</i> a smart long-term choice. </div> </div> </div>I'm actually looking at my book now, and Horner's death was a considerably more shadowy affair than &quot;Garou straight-up frenzy and tear him to pieces&quot;, as he died in a &quot;suspicious hunting accident&quot;, which is left far more ambiguous.<br /> <br /> Meanwhile, vampires drove his successor completely insane, presumably with Dementation, and generally seem to wave their... fangs in front of the agency way more often than werewolves do..","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23-saur-ops-specialist","name":"Saur Ops Specialist","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9371"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-16T18:41:57-07:00","id":971061,"title":"","content":"She's in a mostly Fianna pack. Most likely (given her fur coloration, and the fact that the Fangs are into families like hers) she's probably Silver Fang, though it's not explicitly stated.<br /> <br /> \u200bHorner's death is ambiguous, but the fact that it was suspicious in the first place, coupled with the fact that House Wyrmfoe had a Kinfolk already in place to be maneuvered into position <i>strongly</i> augurs that it was the Fangs that did him in. Regardless, if the humans ever figure out that the Crowes are a Kinfolk lineage, that's what they will assume.<br /> <br /> I agree that the vamps are more overtly in the government's eye. That in no way means that the Garou doing everything in their power to give the government a reason to start hunting for caerns and stockpiling silver munitions is at all a good idea.<br /> <br /> Regardless of what the vamps were up to, Grubholb was SAD's sugar-daddy. Offing him (if that's what really happened) probably contributed to SAD's problems.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imagizer.imageshack.us/v2/125x125q90/19/w20supporterheavymetal1.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imagizer.imageshack.us/v2/125x125q90/546/wpur.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imagizer.imageshack.us/v2/125x125q90/545/7z8m.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imagizer.imageshack.us/v2/125x125q90/829/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3506-uniform-two-six","name":"Uniform Two Six","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3506_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"455"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-16T18:54:07-07:00","id":971071,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Uniform Two Six</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/965959-awws-what-a-lovely-human-lets-keep-it?p=971061#post971061\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">. Regardless, if the humans ever figure out that the Crowes are a Kinfolk lineage, that's what they will assume.<br /></div> </div> </div> </div>Would like to discuss the full ramifications of that.<br /> <br /> SAD would be FURIOUS to find that they'd been subject to GENERATIONAL infiltrators.<br /> <br /> Had this picture of Marsha being outed and told &quot;How could you do this, your Father led the division once ??!?!?!&quot;<br /> <br /> then she sighs and gives an answer depending on the situation, if she led someone into an ambush, she might tell them the truth.<br /> <br /> If shes caught on the inside, she'd probaly either go into &quot;Name, Rank, Serial Number&quot; mode, or kill herself.<br /> <br /> Oh on the original question on the Thread?<br /> <br /> Would being used as &quot;Breeding stock by the Shadow Lords or Get of Fenris, be a valid fate for a Captured member of DNA or the SAD.<br /> <br /> It seems in charachter, but kind of disturbing to mainstream sensibletys.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/2iw20supportergarou125p\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/0j5hz8j\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/i/idnSdTJkj\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://i.imgsafe.org/97fd805379.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":1153,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1153-prince-of-the-night","user":"Prince of the Night","date":". 09-16-2016, 10:08 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1153-prince-of-the-night","name":"Prince of the Night","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4205"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-16T23:44:34-07:00","id":971184,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Prince of the Night</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/965959-awws-what-a-lovely-human-lets-keep-it?p=971071#post971071\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Would like to discuss the full ramifications of that.</div> </div> </div> </div>In short: Hard to gauge, but probably really, <i>really</i> bad.<br /> <br /> \u200bBest case scenario, they designate the tribe a criminal or terrorist organization. The options go downhill from there. Worst case scenario, what happened at the end of the Impergium happens again, but writ-large. The government(s?) come to the conclusion that they are hopelessly outclassed by violent and very much hostile entities and are willing to turn to <i>anyone</i> who can even the odds... and then the Black Spirals show up and go &quot;Hey, so these werewolves who want to burn your cities to the ground and eat your children? Yeah, we're not them. See Endron over there? Yeah, we <i>own</i> that. Magadon? Yeah, we own that too. Why? because we're the <i>good</i> werewolves. We<i> like </i>the idea of cities, technology, industry, and what have you. Oh, and at Magadon we're working on this process we tentatively call ' fomorization' so that you humans will have the ability to defend <i>yourselves</i> from the horrible and evil 'Gaians'.&quot; Basically imagine Pentex, only with the economic (and military) might of the <i>entire</i> G20, and a <i>billion</i> or so eager volunteers to be the first to get nifty &quot;superpowers&quot; (turned into a walking Wyrm-tainted obscenities).<br /> <br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Prince of the Night</strong> </div> <div class=\"message\">Would being used as &quot;Breeding stock by the Shadow Lords or Get of Fenris, be a valid fate for a Captured member of DNA or the SAD.<br /> <br /> It seems in charachter, but kind of disturbing to mainstream sensibletys.</div> </div> </div> </div>Kin or normal human?<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imagizer.imageshack.us/v2/125x125q90/19/w20supporterheavymetal1.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imagizer.imageshack.us/v2/125x125q90/546/wpur.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imagizer.imageshack.us/v2/125x125q90/545/7z8m.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imagizer.imageshack.us/v2/125x125q90/829/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3506-uniform-two-six","name":"Uniform Two Six","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3506_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"455"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-17T05:07:28-07:00","id":971259,"title":"","content":"Message Deleted as irrelevant","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/2iw20supportergarou125p\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/0j5hz8j\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/i/idnSdTJkj\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://i.imgsafe.org/97fd805379.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":1153,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1153-prince-of-the-night","user":"Prince of the Night","date":". 09-17-2016, 04:22 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1153-prince-of-the-night","name":"Prince of the Night","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4205"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-17T05:07:28-07:00","id":971260,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Uniform Two Six</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/965959-awws-what-a-lovely-human-lets-keep-it?p=971184#post971184\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">In short: Hard to gauge, but probably really, <i>really</i> bad.<br /> <br /> \u200bBest case scenario, they designate the tribe a criminal or terrorist organization. The options go downhill from there. Worst case scenario, what happened at the end of the Impergium happens again, but writ-large. The government(s?) come to the conclusion that they are hopelessly outclassed by violent and very much hostile entities and are willing to turn to <i>anyone</i> who can even the odds... and then the Black Spirals show up and go &quot;Hey, so these werewolves who want to burn your cities to the ground and eat your children? Yeah, we're not them. See Endron over there? Yeah, we <i>own</i> that. Magadon? Yeah, we own that too. Why? because we're the <i>good</i> werewolves. We<i> like </i>the idea of cities, technology, industry, and what have you. Oh, and at Magadon we're working on this process we tentatively call ' fomorization' so that you humans will have the ability to defend <i>yourselves</i> from the horrible and evil 'Gaians'.&quot; Basically imagine Pentex, only with the economic (and military) might of the <i>entire</i> G20, and a <i>billion</i> or so eager volunteers to be the first to get nifty &quot;superpowers&quot; (turned into a walking Wyrm-tainted obscenities).<br /> <br /></div> </div> </div> </div><br /> In the best Case Scenariao, the Modern SAD's designation would be irrelevant Thankfully<br /> <br /> I could see them trying to reccomend to the rest of the FBI Closely watching 3 or 4 upstanding deeply respected familys, on par with the Kennedys, and being sneered and laughed at.<br /> <br /> The worse case Scenariao would hopefully be interdicted if they knew that Martin Fiske was also, basicly an infiltrator.<br /> <br /> Which would lead them to be offended I think at being used as pawns on a chess board.<br /> <br /> <br /> Edit: I wont lie I was more thinking how they'd react to learning they'd be infiltrated not to the idea of thinking one of their leaders was assasinated<br /> <br /> Hmmmn what if they didnt find out that the Crowes were a kinfolk line, and didnt even know that Kinfolk EXIST, but did find out Marsha was feeding them intel, before she disappeared either completely or going home, so that to get to her they'd have to go through all kinds of security, and if they tried indicting her, her familys lawyers would rip them to pieces.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Uniform Two Six</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/965959-awws-what-a-lovely-human-lets-keep-it?p=971184#post971184\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Kin or normal human?</div> </div> </div> </div>Normal human, hey you need to to diversify the Genepool, every now and then.<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> oh, on Senator Grubbob one way to deal with him?<br /> <br /> Tell him while using &quot;Infallible argument of Logic&quot; that &quot;The Garou carry the holy bloodline of Gaia. They are the Champions of the Earth Mother. Your Grand Daughter has not been kidnapped, she has accepted her destiny&quot;<br /> <br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/2iw20supportergarou125p\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/0j5hz8j\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/i/idnSdTJkj\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://i.imgsafe.org/97fd805379.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":1153,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1153-prince-of-the-night","user":"Prince of the Night","date":". 09-17-2016, 04:26 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1153-prince-of-the-night","name":"Prince of the Night","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4205"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-17T15:00:23-07:00","id":971528,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Uniform Two Six</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/965959-awws-what-a-lovely-human-lets-keep-it?p=971061#post971061\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">She's in a mostly Fianna pack. Most likely (given her fur coloration, and the fact that the Fangs are into families like hers) she's probably Silver Fang, though it's not explicitly stated.<br /> <br /> \u200bHorner's death is ambiguous, but the fact that it was suspicious in the first place, coupled with the fact that House Wyrmfoe had a Kinfolk already in place to be maneuvered into position <i>strongly</i> augurs that it was the Fangs that did him in.</div> </div> </div> </div>Not really. By that time, he would have had run-ins with a lot of other monsters and occult ritualists, so it actually could have been anything from the quizzical Toreador grudge against the FBI for McCarthyism to a sorcerous curse. A year is a long time to wait for an old-school Garou rampage covered up by the Delirium, too.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Regardless, if the humans ever figure out that the Crowes are a Kinfolk lineage, that's what they will assume. </div> </div> </div>But it seems that they're letting things well alone, during which time evidence is disappearing. Maybe if HH2 had been written for W20, it would have panned out differently, but that's not how things ended up.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> I agree that the vamps are more overtly in the government's eye. That in no way means that the Garou doing everything in their power to give the government a reason to start hunting for caerns and stockpiling silver munitions is at all a good idea. </div> </div> </div>HH2 shifted nearly all of the focus onto vampires, though. Apparently they're such a tremendous problem that the agency doesn't have time for anything else.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Regardless of what the vamps were up to, Grubholb was SAD's sugar-daddy. Offing him (if that's what really happened) probably contributed to SAD's problems. </div> </div> </div>I think what happened to Grubholb was that the authors forgot about him or didn't think that he was a very significant part of Project Twilight. At the very least, the political landscape probably changed; he might have just lost a bid for re-election, and just called it quits with politics, particularly if SAD stopped being very useful.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23-saur-ops-specialist","name":"Saur Ops Specialist","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9371"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-17T15:18:32-07:00","id":971536,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Saur Ops Specialist</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/965959-awws-what-a-lovely-human-lets-keep-it?p=971528#post971528\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">A year is a long time to wait for an old-school Garou rampage covered up by the Delirium, too.</div> </div> </div> </div> \u200bFirst off, a &quot;Garou rampage&quot; would have been unnecessary and probably would have created countless unnecessary witnesses and evidence. A simple, straight-up assassination would have made more sense. Second, I think that Crowe (Andrew Crowe was it? -- I don't have my book at the present time) being near to hand at <i>exactly</i> the right time was just a <i>touch</i> too convenient for it to be a coincidence.<br /> <br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Saur Ops Specialist</strong> </div> <div class=\"message\">But it seems that they're letting things well alone, during which time evidence is disappearing. Maybe if HH2 had been written for W20, it would have panned out differently, but that's not how things ended up.</div> </div> </div> </div> Which is exactly the short-term thinking that has led the Garou (and especially the Silver Fangs) down the tortuous path which they took to their current predicament. At the moment, it's looking up for the Garou vis-\u00e0-vis the U.S. government -- but in the long run that may (very plausibly) turn out to be another exterminate-the-Bunyip fiasco that bites them in the ass.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Prince of the Night</strong> </div> <div class=\"message\">Normal human</div> </div> </div> </div> Not necessary, really. With Animal Magnetism, any Garou that needs to get laid with an ordinary human can do so and the human doesn't even get a Willpower roll.<br /> <br /> As for Garou being douchebag rapists -- sure I could see that. But it's not going to do squat for their recessive-trait and reproduction problem, so why would they? (unless they're hell-bent on eventually joining the Black Spiral Dancers)<br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imagizer.imageshack.us/v2/125x125q90/19/w20supporterheavymetal1.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imagizer.imageshack.us/v2/125x125q90/546/wpur.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imagizer.imageshack.us/v2/125x125q90/545/7z8m.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imagizer.imageshack.us/v2/125x125q90/829/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3506-uniform-two-six","name":"Uniform Two Six","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3506_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"455"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-17T15:30:21-07:00","id":971541,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Uniform Two Six</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/965959-awws-what-a-lovely-human-lets-keep-it?p=971536#post971536\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">\u200bFirst off, a &quot;Garou rampage&quot; would have been unnecessary and probably would have created countless unnecessary witnesses and evidence. A simple, straight-up assassination would have made more sense. Second, I think that Crowe (Andrew Crowe was it? -- I don't have my book at the present time) being near to hand at <i>exactly</i> the right time was just a <i>touch</i> too convenient for it to be a coincidence.<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> Which is exactly the short-term thinking that has led the Garou (and especially the Silver Fangs) down the tortuous path which they took to their current predicament. At the moment, it's looking up for the Garou vis-\u00e0-vis the U.S. government -- but in the long run that may (very plausibly) turn out to be another exterminate-the-Bunyip fiasco that bites them in the ass.<br /> <br /> <br /> Not necessary, really. With Animal Magnetism, any Garou that needs to get laid with an ordinary human can do so and the human doesn't even get a Willpower roll.<br /> <br /> As for Garou being douchebag rapists -- sure I could see that. But it's not going to do squat for their recessive-trait and reproduction problem, so why would they? (unless they're hell-bent on eventually joining the Black Spiral Dancers)<br /></div> </div> </div> </div>You think Being used as human Sacrifices is a better &quot;Fitting end&quot; to a SAD Agent, or DNA employee.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/2iw20supportergarou125p\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/0j5hz8j\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/i/idnSdTJkj\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://i.imgsafe.org/97fd805379.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1153-prince-of-the-night","name":"Prince of the Night","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4205"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-17T16:23:25-07:00","id":971565,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Uniform Two Six</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/965959-awws-what-a-lovely-human-lets-keep-it?p=971536#post971536\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">\u200bFirst off, a &quot;Garou rampage&quot; would have been unnecessary and probably would have created countless unnecessary witnesses and evidence. A simple, straight-up assassination would have made more sense. Second, I think that Crowe (Andrew Crowe was it? -- I don't have my book at the present time) being near to hand at <i>exactly</i> the right time was just a <i>touch</i> too convenient for it to be a coincidence.</div> </div> </div> </div>Possibly. No details are written, so I have to assume it was meant to be something that individual agents in individual games uncover.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Which is exactly the short-term thinking that has led the Garou (and especially the Silver Fangs) down the tortuous path which they took to their current predicament. At the moment, it's looking up for the Garou vis-\u00e0-vis the U.S. government -- but in the long run that may (very plausibly) turn out to be another exterminate-the-Bunyip fiasco that bites them in the ass. </div> </div> </div>At the moment, I think that the Garou are mostly entangled with a different set of adversaries. And the best part? Sh shshshshsh. <br /> <br /> They're learning.<br /> <br /> [/Krieger]<br /> <br /> Seriously, the subtitle on the forum is a major clue. Also, this is more of a metatextual issue; it can't really be about textual short-sightedness.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Not necessary, really. With Animal Magnetism, any Garou that needs to get laid with an ordinary human can do so and the human doesn't even get a Willpower roll. </div> </div> </div>Not actively, but it does play a part - twice, even. The system has the werewolf rolling Charisma + Primal-Urge against a difficulty of the subject's Willpower and needing at least the subject's Willpower + 1 in successes. So it's mechanically highly unlikely to work on a generous chunk of people.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> As for Garou being douchebag rapists -- sure I could see that. But it's not going to do squat for their<b> recessive-trait</b> </div> </div> </div><a href=\"https://youtu.be/TyzKQhmxqVo?t=250\" target=\"_blank\">Blah blah blah BROTHER!<br /> <br /> (Seriously, it's in no way a recessive trait. No protein can account for shit like that.)</a>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23-saur-ops-specialist","name":"Saur Ops Specialist","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9371"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-17T23:12:43-07:00","id":971784,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Prince of the Night</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/965959-awws-what-a-lovely-human-lets-keep-it?p=971541#post971541\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> You think Being used as human Sacrifices is a better &quot;Fitting end&quot; to a SAD Agent, or DNA employee.</div> </div> </div> </div> \u200b1. Just because a human is forced to get it on with a werewolf, doesn't necessarily mean that they get to live at the end. I was sort of assuming that they would be, ahem -- <i>properly disposed of</i> once their immediate usefulness was at an end.<br /> <br /> 2. Just so I'm clear, my options are (a) Beaten, raped, and more or less permanent sex slave, or (b) Dead?<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Saur Ops Specialist</strong> </div> <div class=\"message\"> Seriously, it's in no way a recessive trait...</div> </div> </div> </div> Soooo... with only a 10% chance of passing the trait off to one's offspring under even the most favorable of conditions, it's a <i>dominant</i> trait?<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Saur Ops Specialist</strong> </div> <div class=\"message\"> ...No protein can account for shit like that.</div> </div> </div> </div> Which would be why I used the term &quot;trait&quot; and not &quot;gene&quot;. Nobody said shit about DNA (except for Prince of the Night, who was talking about the biotech corporation and not the protein string).<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imagizer.imageshack.us/v2/125x125q90/19/w20supporterheavymetal1.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imagizer.imageshack.us/v2/125x125q90/546/wpur.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imagizer.imageshack.us/v2/125x125q90/545/7z8m.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imagizer.imageshack.us/v2/125x125q90/829/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3506-uniform-two-six","name":"Uniform Two Six","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3506_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"455"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-18T05:34:03-07:00","id":971894,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Uniform Two Six</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/965959-awws-what-a-lovely-human-lets-keep-it?p=971784#post971784\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Soooo... with only a 10% chance of passing the trait off to one's offspring under even the most favorable of conditions, it's a <i>dominant</i> trait?</div> </div> </div> </div>No, it is a <i>complex</i> trait, since it doesn't follow the typical patterns of Mendelian inheritance. Or would be, if it had anything to do with genetics. Since it has to do with bizarre spirit-flesh hybrid heritage, it's something else entirely.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Which would be why I used the term &quot;trait&quot; and not &quot;gene&quot;. Nobody said shit about DNA (except for Prince of the Night, who was talking about the biotech corporation and not the protein string). </div> </div> </div>Trait and gene are often paired terms in genetics, so your post read the same way. Also, DNA is a string of nucleotides, not a string of proteins.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23-saur-ops-specialist","name":"Saur Ops Specialist","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9371"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-18T08:09:48-07:00","id":971929,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Uniform Two Six</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/965959-awws-what-a-lovely-human-lets-keep-it?p=971784#post971784\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> \u200b1. Just because a human is forced to get it on with a werewolf, doesn't necessarily mean that they get to live at the end. I was sort of assuming that they would be, ahem -- <i>properly disposed of</i> once their immediate usefulness was at an end.<br /> <br /> 2. Just so I'm clear, my options are (a) Beaten, raped, and more or less permanent sex slave, or (b) Dead?<br /> <br /> <br /> Soooo... with only a 10% chance of passing the trait off to one's offspring under even the most favorable of conditions, it's a <i>dominant</i> trait?<br /> <br /> <br /> Which would be why I used the term &quot;trait&quot; and not &quot;gene&quot;. Nobody said shit about DNA (except for Prince of the Night, who was talking about the biotech corporation and not the protein string).</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> Oh one more curious question<br /> <br /> the SAD group, the minutemen, why are they even funner to imagine this kind of fate for?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/2iw20supportergarou125p\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/0j5hz8j\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/i/idnSdTJkj\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://i.imgsafe.org/97fd805379.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1153-prince-of-the-night","name":"Prince of the Night","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4205"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-18T09:27:19-07:00","id":971969,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Prince of the Night</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/965959-awws-what-a-lovely-human-lets-keep-it?p=971929#post971929\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <br /> <br /> Oh one more curious question<br /> <br /> the SAD group, the minutemen, why are they even funner to imagine this kind of fate for?</div> </div> </div> </div>The real question is... you're the one who started the old 'putting hunters in their place' torture porn thread, and you've been dropping comments like this all over the forum. What is it with you and inviting people to participate in your skeevy rape fantasies?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2082-schleiermacher","name":"Schleiermacher","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"190"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-18T10:08:54-07:00","id":971985,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Saur Ops Specialist</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/965959-awws-what-a-lovely-human-lets-keep-it?p=971894#post971894\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <br /> Trait and gene are often paired terms in genetics, so your post read the same way...</div> </div> </div> </div>Well, since I don't have my encyclopedia with me where I am today, I'm forced to reference Wikipedia instead... so:<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Wikipedia</strong> </div> <div class=\"message\">A <b>phenotypic trait</b>, or simply<b> trait</b>, is a distinct variant of a phenotypic characteristic of an organism; it may be either inherited or determined environmentally, but typically occurs as a combination of the two.</div> </div> </div> </div><div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Wikipedia</strong> </div> <div class=\"message\">The inheritable unit that may influence a trait is called a gene.</div> </div> </div> </div>\u200b<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Wikipedia</strong> </div> <div class=\"message\">...This description prefigured the distinction between genotype (the genetic material of an organism) and phenotype (the visible traits of that organism).</div> </div> </div> </div>Nyanh-nyanh-nyanh-nyanh-nyanh-nyanh.<br /> \u200b<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Saur Ops Specialist</strong> </div> <div class=\"message\"> Also, DNA is a string of nucleotides, not a string of proteins.</div> </div> </div> </div>Ah. Quite right. My apologies.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imagizer.imageshack.us/v2/125x125q90/19/w20supporterheavymetal1.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imagizer.imageshack.us/v2/125x125q90/546/wpur.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imagizer.imageshack.us/v2/125x125q90/545/7z8m.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imagizer.imageshack.us/v2/125x125q90/829/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":3506,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3506-uniform-two-six","user":"Uniform Two Six","date":". 09-18-2016, 01:36 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3506-uniform-two-six","name":"Uniform Two Six","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3506_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"455"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-18T11:23:11-07:00","id":972029,"title":"","content":"I think that no Tribe, accept the Black Spiral Dancers, would capture humans for the purpose of rape. That sort of behavior is considered to be part of the Thrall of the Wyrm (along with cannibalism and wanton murder), and would probably lead to the annihilation of the Garou (or the entire pack) when they rest of the Tribe discovered their extracurricular activities. Killing someone quickly when needed is tolerated because that is part of the nature of being Garou (they are the Warriors of Gaia), but rape and torture are behaviors that are part of the nature of the Wyrm.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11683-aya-tari","name":"Aya Tari","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11683_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5986"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-18T13:03:51-07:00","id":972089,"title":"","content":"A fair point, an old Garou Mush log I saw over a decade ago, when just getting into the game inted my views on things.<br /> <br /> but I think your right RAW","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/2iw20supportergarou125p\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/0j5hz8j\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/i/idnSdTJkj\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://i.imgsafe.org/97fd805379.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1153-prince-of-the-night","name":"Prince of the Night","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4205"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-18T13:34:17-07:00","id":972098,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Aya Tari</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/965959-awws-what-a-lovely-human-lets-keep-it?p=972029#post972029\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I think that no Tribe, accept the Black Spiral Dancers, would capture humans for the purpose of rape. That sort of behavior is considered to be part of the Thrall of the Wyrm (along with cannibalism and wanton murder), and would probably lead to the annihilation of the Garou (or the entire pack) when they rest of the Tribe discovered their extracurricular activities. Killing someone quickly when needed is tolerated because that is part of the nature of being Garou (they are the Warriors of Gaia), but rape and torture are behaviors that are part of the nature of the Wyrm.</div> </div> </div> </div>\u200bBut brutally dismembering human adults and kidnapping their children so you can take them back to your sept and slowly torture them to death over the course of a few days (since Gaian Garou actually have a Rite for that)...<i> isn't</i>. Sorry, dude, but I'm calling bullsh*t here. The Garou gleefully engage in murder and, in the past, even outright genocide. A little rape (especially of 'lesser beings&quot; that the Garou almost universally look down upon and generally despise) is small potatoes to them.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imagizer.imageshack.us/v2/125x125q90/19/w20supporterheavymetal1.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imagizer.imageshack.us/v2/125x125q90/546/wpur.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imagizer.imageshack.us/v2/125x125q90/545/7z8m.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imagizer.imageshack.us/v2/125x125q90/829/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3506-uniform-two-six","name":"Uniform Two Six","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3506_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"455"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-18T13:44:29-07:00","id":972100,"title":"","content":"One thing I want to say is for all the environmentalism in its themes, it can be easy to forget the horror aspects of Werewolf<br /> <br /> a bit over a decade ago I played in 2 separate games that saw DNA Scientists captured, then released them all with no more then a moral lecture...<br /> <br /> thats probaly what gives me these &quot;Skeevish fantasys&quot;<br /> <br /> because I so strongly desire to call BS on that.<br /> <br /> Those scientists should have been ... brutally killed, MAYBE Let ONE leave, maimed but alive to report what he saw, and to inform the Rest of Developmental Neogenetics Amalgamated, the same will happen to them if they dont abandon this madness.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Uniform Two Six</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/965959-awws-what-a-lovely-human-lets-keep-it?p=972098#post972098\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">\u200bBut brutally dismembering human adults and kidnapping their children so you can take them back to your sept and slowly torture them to death over the course of a few days (since Gaian Garou actually have a Rite for that)...<i> isn't</i>. .</div> </div> </div> </div>Talking about the Rite of the Dying cubs in the Revised Red Talon book? <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/2iw20supportergarou125p\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/0j5hz8j\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/i/idnSdTJkj\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://i.imgsafe.org/97fd805379.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1153-prince-of-the-night","name":"Prince of the Night","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4205"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-18T14:05:27-07:00","id":972113,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Uniform Two Six</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/965959-awws-what-a-lovely-human-lets-keep-it?p=972098#post972098\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">\u200bBut brutally dismembering human adults and kidnapping their children so you can take them back to your sept and slowly torture them to death over the course of a few days (since Gaian Garou actually have a Rite for that)</div> </div> </div> </div>Curious what Rite you're speaking about? The entire sentence presented above seems very foreign to me. I would have to assume I've come to a different understanding of Garou society if you think this is something they do.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Uniform Two Six</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/965959-awws-what-a-lovely-human-lets-keep-it?p=972098#post972098\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"> The Garou gleefully engage in murder and, in the past, even outright genocide. A little rape (especially of 'lesser beings&quot; that the Garou almost universally look down upon and generally despise) is small potatoes to them.</div> </div> </div> </div>I've always viewed rape (certainly within the context of Werewolf) as being of the Wyrm. I don't know anyone who has played or ran Werewolf that thinks differently. On the &quot;murder&quot; part, Garou kill for the sake of Gaia. Killing needlessly is also generally wyrmish (which isn't to say that it doesn't happen) and is thus looked down upon.<br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://drive.google.com/uc?export=view&amp;id=0B9RzepSqCby3Mi1KUmJ5aWUwRVk\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/805-idpersona","name":"idpersona","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar805_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2117"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-18T14:18:32-07:00","id":972121,"title":"","content":"I think hes referring to a rite of the Dying cub camp in the Revised Red Talon tribe book, which uses humans PAIN to cleanse the land.<br /> <br /> I can look it up if you want? <br /> <br /> its suggested it is PROBALY some trick from the wyrm, but an ST is perfectly within his rights to make it a legitimate, albeit unpleasant weapon against the wyrm.<br /> <br /> Most Talons, even those that Consume human flesh, without a lick of regard for the litany, ABHOR the practice as such sadism, is what the Talons hate about humans.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/2iw20supportergarou125p\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/0j5hz8j\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/i/idnSdTJkj\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://i.imgsafe.org/97fd805379.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1153-prince-of-the-night","name":"Prince of the Night","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4205"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-18T14:48:52-07:00","id":972136,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Uniform Two Six</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/965959-awws-what-a-lovely-human-lets-keep-it?p=971985#post971985\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Well, since I don't have my encyclopedia with me where I am today, I'm forced to reference Wikipedia instead... so:<br /> <br /> Nyanh-nyanh-nyanh-nyanh-nyanh-nyanh.</div> </div> </div> </div>Says the person who was still calling being a Garou recessive over a decade and a half after they rightfully trashed that concept, and who didn't know about complex traits... (^VVVVVV^)<br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23-saur-ops-specialist","name":"Saur Ops Specialist","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9371"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-18T15:59:43-07:00","id":972183,"title":"","content":"The Rite of Feeding the Land superficially cleanses a small amount of land (a 20 foot radius for every point of Willpower lost and health level of lethal damage suffered before the victim dies), but the spiritual guardians of the land ignore Wyrm incursions from then on (Red Talons, p. 73-74). That suggests that it is a Wyrm Rite because it would require a phenomenal amount of humans to cleanse even one square mile (the limiting factor is Willpower and, with the average human having a Willpower 3, that means that more than 220 humans would have to be killed per square mile of contaminated land) and makes the land more vulnerable to Wyrm incursions. The fact that it can also use Garou victims also makes it suspect.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11683-aya-tari","name":"Aya Tari","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11683_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5986"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-18T18:39:54-07:00","id":972257,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Aya Tari</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/965959-awws-what-a-lovely-human-lets-keep-it?p=972183#post972183\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The Rite of Feeding the Land superficially cleanses a small amount of land (a 20 foot radius for every point of Willpower lost and health level of lethal damage suffered before the victim dies), but the spiritual guardians of the land ignore Wyrm incursions from then on (Red Talons, p. 73-74). That suggests that it is a Wyrm Rite because it would require a phenomenal amount of humans to cleanse even one square mile (the limiting factor is Willpower and, with the average human having a Willpower 3, that means that more than 220 humans would have to be killed per square mile of contaminated land) and makes the land more vulnerable to Wyrm incursions. The fact that it can also use Garou victims also makes it suspect.</div> </div> </div> </div>The origin of the rite is explicitly up in the air, per the sidebar on it in the tribebook.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23-saur-ops-specialist","name":"Saur Ops Specialist","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9371"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-19T02:04:13-07:00","id":972409,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>idpersona</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/965959-awws-what-a-lovely-human-lets-keep-it?p=972113#post972113\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I would have to assume I've come to a different understanding of Garou society if you think this is something they do.</div> </div> </div> </div>\u200bSo unless the Red Talons have left the Garou Nation -- that absolutely <i>is</i> something they do.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>idpersona</strong> </div> <div class=\"message\">I've always viewed rape (certainly within the context of Werewolf) as being of the Wyrm. I don't know anyone who has played or ran Werewolf that thinks differently...</div> </div> </div> </div>Considering that there is basically no (or at best minimal) consequences meted out to the Garou who rape their own Kinfolk (on the basis that reproduction is really their <i>only</i> purpose in the eyes of the Garou Nation, and always has been), I would have to say that I think differently.<br /> <br /> \u200bEDIT: To clarify, I do think rape is inherently &quot;of the Wyrm&quot;, but my point is that the Garou (for the most part) genuinely do not give three rat-turds.<br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>idpersona</strong> </div> <div class=\"message\">On the &quot;murder&quot; part, Garou kill for the sake of Gaia. Killing needlessly is also generally wyrmish (which isn't to say that it doesn't happen) and is thus looked down upon.<br /></div> </div> </div> </div>And the fact that there are at least three tribes (Get, Shadow Lords, and Red Talons), as well as huge swaths of other tribes (pretty much the entirety of Clan Crescent Moon, for instance), that feel that the only thing that was wrong with the Impergium was that it <i>ended</i>, counts as being &quot;looked down upon&quot;? There was also the little matter of the War of Rage and the War of Tears (the latter of which, despite<i> knowing </i>that the whole sordid affair was due to the Black Spiral Dancers cynically manipulating the Talons, the Talons <i>still</i> insist that exterminating the Bunyip was a righteous and holy act because they weren't wolfish enough).<br /> <br /> There's a <i>huge</i> difference between what the Garou are (supposedly)<i> supposed </i>to do and what they (in reality) <i>actually </i>do.<br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Saur Ops Specialist</strong> </div> <div class=\"message\">The origin of the rite is explicitly up in the air, per the sidebar on it in the tribebook.</div> </div> </div> </div>Which has bearing on the fact that the Garou regularly perform the rite, <i>how</i>?<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imagizer.imageshack.us/v2/125x125q90/19/w20supporterheavymetal1.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imagizer.imageshack.us/v2/125x125q90/546/wpur.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imagizer.imageshack.us/v2/125x125q90/545/7z8m.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imagizer.imageshack.us/v2/125x125q90/829/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":3506,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3506-uniform-two-six","user":"Uniform Two Six","date":". 09-19-2016, 05:13 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3506-uniform-two-six","name":"Uniform Two Six","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3506_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"455"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-19T07:25:49-07:00","id":972509,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Uniform Two Six</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/965959-awws-what-a-lovely-human-lets-keep-it?p=972409#post972409\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Which has bearing on the fact that the Garou regularly perform the rite, <i>how</i>?</div> </div> </div> </div>Probably very irregularly, since it's the secret of a secret camp of the smallest tribe.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23-saur-ops-specialist","name":"Saur Ops Specialist","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9371"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-19T07:48:36-07:00","id":972523,"title":"","content":"Look at it from a pragmatic point of view. How many Garou are actually going to trust (much less learn or perform) a Rite that leave a spiritual 'Welcome' sign for Banes and Wyrm Creatures? Anyway, Red Talons have a much more effective ritual that does the same thing, the Rite of Gaia's Rebirth, which shows the proper design of a Gaian Rite that cleanses the land.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":11683,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11683-aya-tari","user":"Aya Tari","date":". 09-19-2016, 10:51 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11683-aya-tari","name":"Aya Tari","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11683_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5986"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-19T12:26:36-07:00","id":972643,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Uniform Two Six</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/965959-awws-what-a-lovely-human-lets-keep-it?p=972409#post972409\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">\u200bSo unless the Red Talons have left the Garou Nation -- that absolutely <i>is</i> something they do.</div> </div> </div> </div>It's not something <i>they</i> (The Garou Nation) do. As <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23-saur-ops-specialist\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar23_3.png');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"23\" data-vbnamecard=\"23\">Saur Ops Specialist</a> points out &quot;it's the secret of a secret camp of the smallest tribe.&quot;<br /> How many Garou do you think even know that Rite? Numbers off the top of my head. There are 14k Garou. What percentage of the Nation do you think the Talon comprise? 2%? There are 13 tribes, and the Talons are by far the smallest. That makes maybe 300 Talons in total. From there, its a secret camp within the Tribe. So maybe 20-40 members (in the entire Garou Nation)? And membership alone doesn't mean they even know the Rite. And even if you disagree with the specific numbers, you are talking about an extremely small (and secret) camp of Garou. That does not represent what the Garou Nation at large condones.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Uniform Two Six</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/965959-awws-what-a-lovely-human-lets-keep-it?p=972409#post972409\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Considering that there is basically no (or at best minimal) consequences meted out to the Garou who rape their own Kinfolk (on the basis that reproduction is really their <i>only</i> purpose in the eyes of the Garou Nation, and always has been), I would have to say that I think differently.<br /> <br /> \u200bEDIT: To clarify, I do think rape is inherently &quot;of the Wyrm&quot;, but my point is that the Garou (for the most part) genuinely do not give three rat-turds.</div> </div> </div> </div>I want to say we had this discussion last year and we didn't agree then either. Kinfolk rape is not something Garou see as normal. Kinfolk are your family; your siblings, your parents, your children. Arranged marriages do happen in the Nation. But I don't agree on your view that raping kinfolk is something that is regularly tolerated.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Uniform Two Six</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/965959-awws-what-a-lovely-human-lets-keep-it?p=972409#post972409\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"> And the fact that there are at least three tribes (Get, Shadow Lords, and Red Talons), as well as huge swaths of other tribes (pretty much the entirety of Clan Crescent Moon, for instance), that feel that the only thing that was wrong with the Impergium was that it <i>ended</i>, counts as being &quot;looked down upon&quot;?</div> </div> </div> </div>Imo, the Talons are the only Tribe normally shown to think that ending the Impergium was a mistake. There are individuals that may agree with that, but it's far from &quot;huge swaths&quot;.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Uniform Two Six</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/965959-awws-what-a-lovely-human-lets-keep-it?p=972409#post972409\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"> There was also the little matter of the War of Rage and the War of Tears (the latter of which, despite<i> knowing </i>that the whole sordid affair was due to the Black Spiral Dancers cynically manipulating the Talons, the Talons <i>still</i> insist that exterminating the Bunyip was a righteous and holy act because they weren't wolfish enough).</div> </div> </div> </div>You really like picking the Talons (again, the smallest Tribe) as representing the entire Garou Nation huh?<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Uniform Two Six</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/965959-awws-what-a-lovely-human-lets-keep-it?p=972409#post972409\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"> Which has bearing on the fact that the Garou regularly perform the rite, <i>how</i>?</div> </div> </div> </div>In your mind, how &quot;regularly&quot; do you think this Rite is performed? Again, (at most) 2 dozen Garou worldwide would even know it.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://drive.google.com/uc?export=view&amp;id=0B9RzepSqCby3Mi1KUmJ5aWUwRVk\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/805-idpersona","name":"idpersona","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar805_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2117"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-19T13:18:34-07:00","id":972676,"title":"","content":"Any idea beyond my interprutation, that their appalled by the Sadism, on why TAlons who casually disregard the litany, will still Find the Rite of feeding the land abhorrent.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/2iw20supportergarou125p\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/0j5hz8j\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/i/idnSdTJkj\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://i.imgsafe.org/97fd805379.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1153-prince-of-the-night","name":"Prince of the Night","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4205"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-03T11:19:48-07:00","id":980899,"title":"","content":"So, the PCs are a lesbian couple, they decided to legally adopt the girl and keep it as a secret from anyone else. while they are trying to find a way to turn her into a Kinfolk (with out the sex ritual because obvious reasons).<br /> <br /> Now, im not very familiar with the USA laws or bureaucracy but, anyone knows how is the process of adoption? the girl has no living relatives or anything like that.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Forum's Official's Joker and Trickster. Pardon my bad english, aint my first language (I Speak Spanish).<br /> ST: DtF, HtR, WtO, MtA<br /> Signature Chars: Crowley (hakalu), Joe The Nuwisha (WtA)<br /> Changelings: be afraid of the Technocracian High Five of Doom","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1754-crowley","name":"Crowley","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1754_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1639"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-03T11:34:06-07:00","id":980907,"title":"","content":"Well, legal adoption usually requires an in-depth background check by the state authorities, for criminal behavior and financial stability, usually after a few years of taking care of children in the foster care system (ideally showing the state authorities that you have the compassion and discipline to take care of a young child). The process is usually abbreviated if the child is a relative, like a cousin or a grandchild, and the majority of states only require a cursory background check, to make sure that the person adopting the child is not a sex criminal and to make sure that the person can take care of the child. It would be nearly impossible to keep the adoption of a non-relative secret from anyone, as the relevant state authorities usually interview close associates of the adopting parent. Of course, this is the average state. Some states, like New Jersey, are well known for cutting corners though, usually resulting in some horrific consequences for the children.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11683-aya-tari","name":"Aya Tari","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11683_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5986"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-03T12:55:55-07:00","id":980959,"title":"","content":"wondered how Garou tribes usualy handle adoptions of underage kin and cubs.<br /> <br /> since in most cases, they do like to keep them close to the nation.<br /> <br /> Think this might be grounds for another Kinship Fellowship? , lawyers and such helping to force adoptions through.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/2iw20supportergarou125p\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/0j5hz8j\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/i/idnSdTJkj\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://i.imgsafe.org/97fd805379.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1153-prince-of-the-night","name":"Prince of the Night","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4205"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-03T13:37:30-07:00","id":980989,"title":"","content":"Or just do what the Children of Gaia in the Heaven Network do: Kidnap the kid. Most Garou live pretty far off the grid anyhow. Ultimately it's no different than a Garou cub that undergoes a first change in which he wipes out a couple dozen innocent people. They just change the kid's name and disappear.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imagizer.imageshack.us/v2/125x125q90/19/w20supporterheavymetal1.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imagizer.imageshack.us/v2/125x125q90/546/wpur.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imagizer.imageshack.us/v2/125x125q90/545/7z8m.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imagizer.imageshack.us/v2/125x125q90/829/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3506-uniform-two-six","name":"Uniform Two Six","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3506_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"455"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-03T13:49:48-07:00","id":981000,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Uniform Two Six</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/965959-awws-what-a-lovely-human-lets-keep-it?p=980989#post980989\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Or just do what the Children of Gaia in the Heaven Network do: Kidnap the kid. Most Garou live pretty far off the grid anyhow. Ultimately it's no different than a Garou cub that undergoes a first change in which he wipes out a couple dozen people. They just change the kid's name and disappear.</div> </div> </div> </div>So pretty much this.<br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Crowley</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/965959-awws-what-a-lovely-human-lets-keep-it?p=980899#post980899\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">So, the PCs are a lesbian couple, they decided to legally adopt the girl and keep it as a secret from anyone else. while they are trying to find a way to turn her into a Kinfolk (with out the sex ritual because obvious reasons).<br /> <br /> Now, im not very familiar with the USA laws or bureaucracy but, anyone knows how is the process of adoption? the girl has no living relatives or anything like that.</div> </div> </div> </div>I just don't see a legal way to adopt the kid. But legal doesn't equal right, especially concerning Garou society. And if you did want the adoption to be legal, then keeping it a secret is pretty much right out since you'll need to involve Kinfolk networks that the PCs probably don't have an so will have to call in favors.<br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://drive.google.com/uc?export=view&amp;id=0B9RzepSqCby3Mi1KUmJ5aWUwRVk\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/805-idpersona","name":"idpersona","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar805_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2117"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-03T16:03:21-07:00","id":981082,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>idpersona</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/965959-awws-what-a-lovely-human-lets-keep-it?p=981000#post981000\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">So pretty much this.<br /> <br /> I just don't see a legal way to adopt the kid. But legal doesn't equal right, especially concerning Garou society. And if you did want the adoption to be legal, then keeping it a secret is pretty much right out since you'll need to involve Kinfolk networks that the PCs probably don't have an so will have to call in favors.<br /></div> </div> </div> </div>the problem is that the PC's are on the grid. specially since they are now living in NY. <br /> also they believe that if they turn the girl into a kinfolk, it woudnt be technically breaking the litany. since she is part of their family and a kinfolk.. so... what ya guys think?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Forum's Official's Joker and Trickster. Pardon my bad english, aint my first language (I Speak Spanish).<br /> ST: DtF, HtR, WtO, MtA<br /> Signature Chars: Crowley (hakalu), Joe The Nuwisha (WtA)<br /> Changelings: be afraid of the Technocracian High Five of Doom","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1754-crowley","name":"Crowley","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1754_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1639"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-03T16:31:55-07:00","id":981096,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Crowley</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/965959-awws-what-a-lovely-human-lets-keep-it?p=981082#post981082\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> the problem is that the PC's are on the grid. specially since they are now living in NY.<br /> also they believe that if they turn the girl into a kinfolk, it woudnt be technically breaking the litany. since she is part of their family and a kinfolk.. so... what ya guys think?</div> </div> </div> </div>NY as in NYC? or just the state?<br /> In NYC, I guarantee you no one will care. More especially in the WoD.<br /> Living in a more rural area, the problem can be solved by just moving. At that point they are just a couple moving in with a kid. There isn't going to be an aboveboard legal way to adopt the kid. Garou don't tend to play nice with bureaucracy.<br /> <br /> If there is a (gaian) way to turn the kid into kinfolk, than by definition it can't really be breaking the litany.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://drive.google.com/uc?export=view&amp;id=0B9RzepSqCby3Mi1KUmJ5aWUwRVk\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/805-idpersona","name":"idpersona","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar805_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2117"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-03T17:12:01-07:00","id":981116,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>idpersona</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/965959-awws-what-a-lovely-human-lets-keep-it?p=981096#post981096\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> NY as in NYC? or just the state?<br /> In NYC, I guarantee you no one will care. More especially in the WoD.<br /> Living in a more rural area, the problem can be solved by just moving. At that point they are just a couple moving in with a kid. There isn't going to be an aboveboard legal way to adopt the kid. Garou don't tend to play nice with bureaucracy.<br /> <br /> If there is a (gaian) way to turn the kid into kinfolk, than by definition it can't really be breaking the litany.</div> </div> </div> </div>yes, its NYC.<br /> Two: there was a debate on other thread i made. because the &quot;parents.&quot; are an homosexual couple of garous. a metis and a hominid (whom by very definition, cant have children) so instead they decided to legally adopt the girl that they saved and trying to turn into a kinfolk (Becase, even if the litany says that two garous shall not mate. they are still producing a Warrior, even if its adopted, acording to my player's logic..which i see as a massive middle finger to any Litany Abiding Garou...but....its still technically correct)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Forum's Official's Joker and Trickster. Pardon my bad english, aint my first language (I Speak Spanish).<br /> ST: DtF, HtR, WtO, MtA<br /> Signature Chars: Crowley (hakalu), Joe The Nuwisha (WtA)<br /> Changelings: be afraid of the Technocracian High Five of Doom","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1754-crowley","name":"Crowley","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1754_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1639"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-03T21:07:21-07:00","id":981253,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Crowley</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/965959-awws-what-a-lovely-human-lets-keep-it?p=981116#post981116\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> yes, its NYC.<br /> Two: there was a debate on other thread i made. because the &quot;parents.&quot; are an homosexual couple of garous. a metis and a hominid (whom by very definition, cant have children) so instead they decided to legally adopt the girl that they saved and trying to turn into a kinfolk (Becase, even if the litany says that two garous shall not mate. they are still producing a Warrior, even if its adopted, acording to my player's logic..which i see as a massive middle finger to any Litany Abiding Garou...but....its still technically correct)</div> </div> </div> </div>So yea, 2 people in NYC suddely having a kid is going to get an eyebrow raise at best (and absolutely nothing more).<br /> <br /> My thoughts:<br /> How are they producing a warrior exactly? The litany doesn't care whatsoever about adoption. I'm going to go ahead and assume that the relationship between the 2 Garou isn't known or they have bigger problems than any of this. A pack taking in a kid would be looked down upon but if the kid ends up as kinfolk, it would be a lot less so. It still isn't safe for the child, and that would really be the biggest sticking point from an elder perspective I think. Mind you, if the Sept finds out that the child wasn't/isn't kinfolk, then the pair of Garou are breaking the Veil and that will be dealt with.<br /> So they need to find some way to magic the kid into being kinfolk before any other Garou find out what's going on. Maybe some lost Apis Rite can make it happen.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://drive.google.com/uc?export=view&amp;id=0B9RzepSqCby3Mi1KUmJ5aWUwRVk\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/805-idpersona","name":"idpersona","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar805_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2117"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-11T18:20:02-07:00","id":985839,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Uniform Two Six</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/965959-awws-what-a-lovely-human-lets-keep-it?p=970991#post970991\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Considering that his daughter was a Silver Fang (as in a werewolf), it sort of begs the question. Grubholb might have been unknowing Kin himself, in which case the tribe sooner or later probably would have considered him a liability at best and a traitor at worst. Alternately, he could have been perfectly normal and inadvertently married into &quot;the family&quot; (so to speak). Either way, considering how careless the Fangs apparently are about bumping off high-profile government people, I would expect that's <i>precisely</i> what happened to him. Probably why the SAD went into decline too.<br /> <br /> <br /> Which may or may not (probably not, if history is any guide) be a permanent condition. Dismissively offing government people is <i>not</i> a smart long-term choice.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Oh one idea?<br /> <br /> What if he was &quot;Dealt with&quot; in a more subtle fashion.<br /> <br /> &quot;Infallable argument of logic&quot; &quot;Garou Blood is holy, we are the goddesses chosen warriors&quot;<br /> <br /> causing him to believe that with unquestioning certainty, could cause him to come in and sigh saying he'd &quot;Lost Faith&quot; in the SAD.<br /> <br /> If he handled it properly, they'd see nothing to investigate then, since they hadnt been able to find his grand daughter.<br /> <br /> <br /> And also curious how the SAD Would feel if they found out they'd been INFILTRATED and one of the infiltrators had reached a position of authority, without the conclusion of &quot;Murdering the Head&quot; <br /> <br /> as Generational infiltrators really knocks them.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/2iw20supportergarou125p\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/0j5hz8j\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/i/idnSdTJkj\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://i.imgsafe.org/97fd805379.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1153-prince-of-the-night","name":"Prince of the Night","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4205"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-11T23:57:48-07:00","id":985978,"title":"","content":"i dont have a credit card, so im waiting for a physical version of Kinfolk. Does the new book mentions anything about rituals or ways to turn a simple human into a kinfolk?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Forum's Official's Joker and Trickster. Pardon my bad english, aint my first language (I Speak Spanish).<br /> ST: DtF, HtR, WtO, MtA<br /> Signature Chars: Crowley (hakalu), Joe The Nuwisha (WtA)<br /> Changelings: be afraid of the Technocracian High Five of Doom","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1754-crowley","name":"Crowley","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1754_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1639"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-12T01:14:11-07:00","id":985992,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>idpersona</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/965959-awws-what-a-lovely-human-lets-keep-it?p=972643#post972643\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I want to say we had this discussion last year and we didn't agree then either. Kinfolk rape is not something Garou see as normal. Kinfolk are your family; your siblings, your parents, your children. Arranged marriages do happen in the Nation. But I don't agree on your view that raping kinfolk is something that is regularly tolerated.</div> </div> </div> </div>And if the Garou in question is still a useful asset in the fight against the Wyrm -- and the product of his, ahem...<i> little indiscretion</i>, is a child who has a flat 10% chance of being Garou... are they going to execute the dude or do something else that takes him out of the line, or are they going to give him a little slap on the wrist in the form of a very modest loss of renown (because you don't want to get too harsh for fear that he's going to just say f*** it and bail) which incentivizes him to go out and be even <i>more</i> awesome in killing Wyrm-things? If the latter (no matter <i>how</i> they want to spin it), it is tolerating Kin-rape.<br /> <br /> EDIT: For clarification, not <i>encouraging</i> it and not <i>tolerating</i> it are two entirely different things.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>idpersona</strong> </div> <div class=\"message\">Imo, the Talons are the only Tribe normally shown to think that ending the Impergium was a mistake. There are individuals that may agree with that, but it's far from &quot;huge swaths&quot;.</div> </div> </div> </div>How many individuals does it take before you're at &quot;huge swaths&quot;? Because it sure seems like there's a lot of them. Another one just popped up in Poison Tree, where the new sept leader (a Shadow Lord -- big surprise) in response to a question from a visiting Garou if there are consequences to killing humans in the city, and she replies simply that (something to the effect of) &quot;If it were up to me, we'd still be culling them&quot;. With the Get and the Shadow Lords, that kind of crap pops up with rather significant frequency. Like, <i>seriously</i>? You <i>really</i> read the Lords as being too <i>honorable</i> to engage in that kind of thinking?<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>idpersona</strong> </div> <div class=\"message\">You really like picking the Talons (again, the smallest Tribe) as representing the entire Garou Nation huh?</div> </div> </div> </div>And once again, the Get, Shadow Lords, Silver Fangs, and Fianna all jumped in enthusiastically -- so pretty much, yeah.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>idpersona</strong> </div> <div class=\"message\">In your mind, how &quot;regularly&quot; do you think this Rite is performed? Again, (at most) 2 dozen Garou worldwide would even know it.</div> </div> </div> </div>And that has bearing that as a Rite, you have to have spirits empower it, <i>how</i>? Unless it's okay to summon Banes in the heart of a caern -- it really does not matter how regularly it's performed. If Gaian spirits are empowering the Rite, then it has the Official Gaia Seal of Approval, and only the Children of Gaia are really going to be upset (and nobody cares what they think).<br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Prince of the Night</strong> </div> <div class=\"message\">Oh one idea?<br /> <br /> What if he was &quot;Dealt with&quot; in a more subtle fashion.<br /> <br /> &quot;Infallable argument of logic&quot; &quot;Garou Blood is holy, we are the goddesses chosen warriors&quot;<br /> <br /> causing him to believe that with unquestioning certainty, could cause him to come in and sigh saying he'd &quot;Lost Faith&quot; in the SAD.<br /> <br /> If he handled it properly, they'd see nothing to investigate then, since they hadnt been able to find his grand daughter.</div> </div> </div> </div>Yeah that could work, actually.<br /> <br /> This is the perfect example of why I <i>hate</i> that Gift. The Garou have a mind-rape Gift that<i> totally </i>outdoes everything the Kindred have (Dominate is generally time-sensitive and wears off outside of the Dominating vampire's presence -- even Blood Bonding someone doesn't work quite that well).<br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Prince of the Night</strong> </div> <div class=\"message\">And also curious how the SAD Would feel if they found out they'd been INFILTRATED and one of the infiltrators had reached a position of authority, without the conclusion of &quot;Murdering the Head&quot;<br /> <br /> as Generational infiltrators really knocks them.</div> </div> </div> </div>Considering that the FBI cut their teeth on paranormal stuff investigating vampires, I'd think that once they got a feel for what Kin are, it wouldn't really throw them all that much. Remember that the Soviets (as in, in the real world) have used so-called &quot;sleeper&quot; agents before, and the possibility of generational ones have been theorized for a long time. For me, the idea that they would learn about the Crowes and somehow <i>not</i> come to the conclusion that Horner was assassinated, would be the real shocker.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imagizer.imageshack.us/v2/125x125q90/19/w20supporterheavymetal1.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imagizer.imageshack.us/v2/125x125q90/546/wpur.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imagizer.imageshack.us/v2/125x125q90/545/7z8m.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imagizer.imageshack.us/v2/125x125q90/829/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":3506,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3506-uniform-two-six","user":"Uniform Two Six","date":". 10-12-2016, 04:19 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3506-uniform-two-six","name":"Uniform Two Six","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3506_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"455"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-12T06:38:39-07:00","id":986098,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Uniform Two Six</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/965959-awws-what-a-lovely-human-lets-keep-it?p=985992#post985992\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">it has the Official Gaia Seal of Approval, and only the Children of Gaia are really going to be upset (and nobody cares what they think).<br /> <br /> Yeah that could work, actually.<br /> <br /> This is the perfect example of why I <i>hate</i> that Gift. The Garou have a mind-rape Gift that<i> totally </i>outdoes everything the Kindred have (Dominate is generally time-sensitive and wears off outside of the Dominating vampire's presence -- even Blood Bonding someone doesn't work quite that well).<br /></div> </div> </div> </div><span style=\"color:#252C2F\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:13px\">Think Him just &quot;Losing interest&quot; in the SAD, or deliberately leading them into a trap, would be the way to go&quot; </span></span></span><br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Uniform Two Six</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/965959-awws-what-a-lovely-human-lets-keep-it?p=985992#post985992\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Considering that the FBI cut their teeth on paranormal stuff investigating vampires, I'd think that once they got a feel for what Kin are, it wouldn't really throw them all that much. Remember that the Soviets (as in, in the real world) have used so-called &quot;sleeper&quot; agents before, and the possibility of generational ones have been theorized for a long time. For me, the idea that they would learn about the Crowes and somehow <i>not</i> come to the conclusion that Horner was assassinated, would be the real shocker.</div> </div> </div> </div>Hmmmn what if they found out about Marshas spying but not about what Kinfolk are or who her father was.<br /> <br /> I could really see, &quot;Marsha how could you do this, your father led the Division!&quot; <br /> <br /> what she said would depend on if she was being interrogated or had led agents into a trap.<br /> Or if they Tried designating the tribe a &quot;terrorist group, in X20, and got laughed off.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/2iw20supportergarou125p\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/0j5hz8j\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/i/idnSdTJkj\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://i.imgsafe.org/97fd805379.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":1153,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1153-prince-of-the-night","user":"Prince of the Night","date":". 10-12-2016, 11:49 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1153-prince-of-the-night","name":"Prince of the Night","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4205"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-12T14:20:26-07:00","id":986378,"title":"","content":"Rape is not an indiscretion, it is a contamination of the Wyrm. Garou have solutions for that sort of contamination, they can go to Erebus and have the contamination burned from their soul, so I doubt that any Tribe would tolerate a member who was unwilling to repent through suffering.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11683-aya-tari","name":"Aya Tari","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11683_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5986"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-12T14:42:53-07:00","id":986396,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Prince of the Night</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/965959-awws-what-a-lovely-human-lets-keep-it?p=986098#post986098\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <span style=\"color:#252C2F\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:13px\">Think Him just &quot;Losing interest&quot; in the SAD, or deliberately leading them into a trap, would be the way to go&quot; </span></span></span><br /> <br /> Hmmmn what if they found out about Marshas spying but not about what Kinfolk are or who her father was.<br /> <br /> I could really see, &quot;Marsha how could you do this, your father led the Division!&quot;</div> </div> </div> </div>Well, if they somehow figured out she was an enemy agent, but not <i>why</i> she's an enemy agent, that would be... odd. But, okay. Presuming that they didn't assume that she was secretly a werewolf herself, and assuming that they can verify that she wasn't being paid off (like Robert Hanssen), it would beg the question why she became a spy -- but it's World of Darkness, so just throw that particular unexplained mystery on the pile and move on...<br /> <br /> After that, just gather all the evidence of criminal misconduct, put it in an envelope, walk it across the street to the Justice Department, so the Attorney General's office can start their prosecution for espionage and high treason, and have Facilities send someone up to clean out her office while she spends the next 75 years or so in prison.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imagizer.imageshack.us/v2/125x125q90/19/w20supporterheavymetal1.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imagizer.imageshack.us/v2/125x125q90/546/wpur.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imagizer.imageshack.us/v2/125x125q90/545/7z8m.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imagizer.imageshack.us/v2/125x125q90/829/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3506-uniform-two-six","name":"Uniform Two Six","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3506_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"455"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-12T14:44:01-07:00","id":986397,"title":"","content":"Some people may feel it adds a primal &quot;Barbarian Flavour&quot; to things.<br /> <br /> <br /> As to that being authentic, sadly, look at Deuteranamy 21:10-14.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"http://biblehub.com/nasb/deuteronomy/21.htm\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"http://biblehub.com/left.png\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://biblehub.com/nasb/deuteronomy/21.htm\" target=\"_blank\"> Deuteronomy 21 NASB 1995 </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://biblehub.com/nasb/deuteronomy/21.htm\" target=\"_blank\"> http://biblehub.com/nasb/deuteronomy/21.htm </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> I dont pretend its right, but look at that verse.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/2iw20supportergarou125p\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/0j5hz8j\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/i/idnSdTJkj\" bor